<title>PERU: Peru's Cementos Lima Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Peru's Cementos Lima Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - n.a.</p>
<p>Net - 23.4 million soles vs 18.2 million soles.</p>
<p>Revs - 106.6 million soles vs 93.1 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: Cementos Lima is Peru's leading cement company.</p>
<p>((-- Andrew Cawthorne, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
